      "message": "\u003e Understood, is there any reason why the implementation library is not created with module.sdkComponentPropertiesForChildLibrary()\n\nI think for the use case of source vs prebuilts selection using `SdkLibraryName`, it is not necessary on the impl since impl of sdk libary is not available as a prebuilt. Do you have a use case in mind that requires adding `SdkLibraryName` to the implementation library as well?\n\n\u003e  Will apex_contributions list every modules dynamically created from java_sdk_library, or only the ones that contribute to stubs generation?\n\nIt will list the \"root\" sdk library\n```\napex_contributions {\n  name: \"conscrypt.source.contributions\",\n  contents: [\n    \"conscrypt.module.public.api\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.intra.core.api\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.platform.api\",\n    ...\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nand not\n```\napex_contributions {\n  name: \"conscrypt.source.contributions\",\n  contents: [\n    \"conscrypt.module.public.api\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.public.api.stubs\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.public.api.stubs.system\",\n    ...\n    \n    \"conscrypt.module.intra.core.api\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.intra.core.api.stubs\",\n    ...\n    \"conscrypt.module.platform.api\",\n    \"conscrypt.module.platform.api.stubs\",\n    ...\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nI think aosp/2808754 has more details on how `SdkLibraryName` is being used. I have cc\u0027d you there.",
